sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application Pods
    participant Collector as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC<br/>4318/TCP HTTP
    participant Prometheus as MonitoringStack Prometheus<br/>8889/TCP HTTPS
    participant NSProxy as Namespace Proxy<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ClusterProxy as Cluster Proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Tempo as Tempo<br/>4317/TCP gRPC
    participant User as End User / Dashboard

    Note over App,Tempo: Flow 1: Metrics Collection Pipeline
    App->>Collector: OTLP metrics<br/>:4317 gRPC / :4318 HTTP<br/>TLS, NetworkPolicy restricted
    Collector->>Prometheus: Scrape metrics<br/>:8889 HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-CA)
    Prometheus->>NSProxy: Query metrics<br/>:9090 HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-CA), mTLS
    NSProxy->>Route: Namespace-scoped response<br/>:8443 HTTPS<br/>kube-rbac-proxy (Bearer)
    Route->>User: Filtered metrics<br/>:443 HTTPS<br/>TLS reencrypt

    Note over App,Tempo: Flow 1b: Cluster-wide Metrics Access
    Prometheus->>ClusterProxy: Query metrics<br/>:8443 HTTPS<br/>kube-rbac-proxy (Bearer)
    ClusterProxy->>Route: Cluster-wide response<br/>:443 HTTPS<br/>TLS reencrypt
    Route->>User: All metrics<br/>:443 HTTPS

    Note over App,Tempo: Flow 2: Distributed Tracing Pipeline
    App->>Collector: OTLP traces<br/>:4317 gRPC<br/>TLS, NetworkPolicy restricted
    Collector->>Tempo: Forward traces<br/>:4317 OTLP/gRPC<br/>TLS, RBAC (trace export role)

    Note over App,Tempo: Flow 3: Webhook Label Injection
    participant KubeAPI as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS

    KubeAPI->>Webhook: Admission request<br/>:9443 HTTPS<br/>TLS (cert-manager)
    Webhook->>KubeAPI: Namespace lookup<br/>:6443 HTTPS<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Webhook->>KubeAPI: Monitoring CR lookup<br/>:6443 HTTPS<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Mutated response<br/>(scrape label injected)
